%!PS
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 300 200
/Helvetica findfont 28 scalefont setfont
20 140 moveto (Hello, PostScript) show
/Times-Italic findfont 20 scalefont setfont
0.6 0.1 0.3 setrgbcolor
20 100 moveto (Text is just more paint.) show
gsave
  20 40 translate  15 rotate
  /Courier findfont 18 scalefont setfont
  0 0 moveto (turned with the axes) show
grestore
showpage
